    "_X5_note": "Queries are the safe window into state. You can call any query at any time, in any order, as many times as you want, and the system remains unchanged. This safety is what makes queries the foundation of testing — assert the observable, trust the internal.",
    "_X5_scripture": "Psalm 139:1-2 — O LORD, thou hast searched me, and known me. Thou knowest my downsitting and mine uprising, thou understandest my thought afar off."
